Z||000039||Fierochic88||05-31-2001||08:18 PM||||Alright, so I'm a little late in responding (Sorry Lisa - computer was on a hiatus!) but I'd have to say that she sounds like a player.  Not that I've never done something like that myself, but sometimes once you get to know someone a little better you realize you may be better being friends but the "I'm down for a drink sometime" comment may mean that she would like to keep you in her life to some degree, possibly as merely a friend.  Sometimes this decision is better for you, maybe she feels her presence in your life could cause you to alter it to a point that you wouldn't be "you" anymore.  Just a thought.  And BTW - any guy that cancels a date with me to work on a Fiero wouldn't really be canceling a date...it would just be an alteration of plans!  I'd be there in a heartbeat!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Silver 1988 GT<BR>Silver 1986 2m4<BR>||||reg||6
